 and indeed we've come a  long way since gravity  melies made a capsule fly so kubrick  could defy the laws of gravity  so cuaron could capture the light of the  solar system  each might seem like a small step on its  own  but taken all together it was one giant  leap for cinema  one dust cloud at a time  [Music]  you
 

